  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">PIMS-9581 Sustainable livestock in the Arenal-North Huetar Conservation Area (ACAHN)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">This is a Child Project of the Food Systems Integrated Programme. As such, it is aligned with the IP&#x2019;s Theory of Change which is focused on addressing various systemic challenges and barriers that limit the transformation of food systems towards nature-positive, resilient, low-carbon, and gender-inclusive practices. The project&#x2019;s objective is to catalyze the transformation of the livestock sector to a sustainable and regenerative food system in Costa Rica</narrative>
  </description>
